<title>MEXICO: GSerfin sells unit to USF&amp;G.</title>
<headline>GSerfin sells unit to USF&amp;G.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Financiero Serfin, S.A. said on Tuesday that it had closed the sale of its subsidiary, Afianzadora Insurgentes Serfin S.A., to United States Fidelity and Guaranty Co for $65 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said that, with the sale, Grupo Serfin has reached 66 percent of its capitalization program. &quot;The funds from the transaction will be used by the group to capitalize its subsidiary Banca Serfin, S.A.,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>United States Fidelity and Guaranty Co is the main subscriber of USF&amp;G Corp.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559</p>
</text>
